{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817df352dbd22b2d.poster.avif?t=1761838070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817df352dbd22b2d.webm?t=1761838070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817df352dbd22b2d.mp4?t=1761838070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever felt that sense of wonder while gazing at a \u26c5 <strong>cloudy sky</strong>, or the cozy feeling of watching a \u26c8\ufe0f <strong>storm</strong>\u00a0pass outside your window? Those moments inspired <strong>Cloudscrapers</strong>, our minimalist strategy game about building towers and scraping the clouds. It's perfect for anyone who enjoys thoughtful gameplay without overly complex systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with simple tools and build the <strong>tallest tower</strong> you can. With every climb, you will learn something new, improve and unlock <strong>upgrades</strong> to help you build even higher next time. As your tower rises, you\u2019ll find ancient relics and uncover mysteries buried deep within the clouds \u2013 though some of them should be better left untouched.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-sized strategy gameplay</strong> that\u2019s perfect for a relaxing session after work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up</strong>, with just the right amount of depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No <strong>complicated menus</strong> or <strong>systems</strong>\u00a0\u2013\u00a0just intuitive building mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression</strong>\u00a0that feels rewarding, not grindy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hand-drawn, atmospheric world</strong> with a mystery that unfolds as you reach new heights.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562200?t=1761838070","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/523625659d7437e2c023659e4cb680ddad098dc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761838070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/13d5ff6ba2acbfb0caee20d17449de7590ab26af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761838070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/13d5ff6ba2acbfb0caee20d17449de7590ab26af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761838070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Newsletter Sign-Up (Claim Free Gift \ud83c\udf81): Website Link in Sidebar \u27a1</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/a0ead930508663ef80e8449c5c80c5b6.avif?t=1761838070\" width=1000 height=249 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817df352dbd22b2d.poster.avif?t=1761838070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817df352dbd22b2d.webm?t=1761838070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/65e76d3284648d46817